{
  "_about": "Sound effects. pack = the folder in src/assets/sounds (uisfx 'organic', CC0). cues: game moment -> { file, volume (0-1), pitchJitter (random +/- fraction) }. masterVolume for everything. Muting is saved in the progress (settings.muted).",
